  = must: define future implementation files, fixture roots, expected ledger roots, generated projection roots, adapter carrier boundaries, dependency decision boundary, command plan, and proof checklist
  = must: preserve that actual code creation, fixture source creation, expected ledger creation, generated output creation, dependency installation, and package metadata mutation remain gated until later implementation activation slices accept them
