  + [future_code_file_role] is define authority display envelope, authority tier, trust limit, permitted action, forbidden action, and route validation models
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/projection_state.py
  + [future_code_file_role] is define projection state envelope, freshness state, stop-state context, refusal records, and stale trigger helpers
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/projectors.py
  + [future_code_file_role] is build manager, worker, narrative, debug, conversation, adapter, Langflow, runtime handoff, and operation-like projection records from fixture data
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/action_routes.py
  + [future_code_file_role] is classify observe, comment, propose, work, claim, review, rebake, interrupt, human override, dry-run, and completion review requests without mutating authority
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/generated_paths.py
  + [future_code_file_role] is validate generated surface projection paths and refuse writes outside accepted generated roots
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/surfaces/fixture_runner.py
  + [future_code_file_role] is load tracked IR5 fixture source and expected ledgers, build projections, compare expected records, and write generated outputs only under accepted roots
  + [future_test_file] is tests/test_ir5_surface_projection_contracts.py

  = must: require deeper reasoning review before creating or editing files outside this inventory for IR5 surface projection implementation
  = must: keep code and test creation gated until specific implementation activation slices open

