& [PublicAPIBoundary: IR5SurfaceProjectionPrototype] is the future public API boundary for IR5 implementation
  + [api] is validate_authority_display_envelope(envelope, authority_basis, policy) returns accepted or projection fault
  + [api] is build_projection_state(input_record, projection_policy) returns projection state envelope
  + [api] is project_manager_summary(input_packet, projection_policy) returns manager summary projection
  + [api] is project_worker_packet(input_packet, projection_policy) returns worker packet projection
  + [api] is project_narrative(input_packet, projection_policy) returns narrative projection
  + [api] is project_debug_trace(input_packet, projection_policy) returns debug trace projection
  + [api] is project_conversation(input_packet, projection_policy) returns conversation projection
  + [api] is project_adapter_event(input_packet, projection_policy) returns adapter event projection
  + [api] is project_langflow_view(input_packet, projection_policy) returns explanatory Langflow projection record without installing Langflow
  + [api] is project_operation_request(input_packet, projection_policy) returns dry-run request, refusal, or safety review projection
  + [api] is classify_surface_action(action_packet, projection_policy) returns route, refusal, or SOP-first interrupt context
  + [api] is validate_generated_surface_output_path(path, generated_output_policy) returns accepted generated path or refusal
  + [api] is run_surface_projection_fixture(fixture_case, expected_ledger, runner_policy) returns generated fixture comparison report
  + [api_status] is future implementation target only

  = must: make refusal, stale, fault, interrupt, stop-state, authority tier, and non-authority status visible in return values
  = must: avoid APIs named or shaped as live transport, adapter socket, web server, UI renderer, agent dispatch, job control, process control, GPU control, model runtime control, network control, credential access, operations control, or live machine control

